config PROFILE_AMD64
    prompt "Target profile"
    type choice
    var ROSCONFIG_PROFILE
    value generic "Generic AMD64"
    value lattepandamu "LattePanda Mu"
    value server "LiberNT Server (headless)"
    default generic
    depends ARCH=amd64
    help
      Generic builds the architecture-independent AMD64 target.

      LattePanda Mu adds the board-specific UEFI HTTP boot option in the
      Boot options menu and its external UEFI network stack.

      LiberNT Server builds the headless Server edition of the
      preinstalled image: a command prompt shell, the server product
      type and the SAC serial console on COM1.
